  "content": "\n\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>必須安裝核心模組「<a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superb-warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperB Warfare</a>」，本整合包才能正常運作！</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">本整合包仍在深度開發中</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><br></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\">此 SuperB Warfare 擴充模組新增了軍事載具。於未來更新中，我們計畫新增：</span></h2>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">1. 無人機</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">2. 戰車</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">3. 直升機</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">4. 其他軍事載具</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>我們也推薦下載適用於 SBW 的 Vanilla 風格資源包</strong> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcsp-military-vehicle\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] MCSP - ADDON - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">嚴禁轉載至其他網站</span></span></strong></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Gralva Studio、QMP、Roif 與 VVP Team 製作之素材保留所有權利。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">請前往 Discord 回報問題 - <a href=\"https://discord.gg/25XqCnUb4X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord VVP</a></span></span></span></strong></span></p>",
